  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 21-layer HfO2/SiO2 defect-cavity stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2. Freeze layers 0-7 at thicknesses [250.6, 306.5, 256.0, 300.9, 269.6, 278.7, 239.9, 252.1] nm from previous best candidate. Constrain layer 10 (central HfO2 cavity) optical thickness to 380-430 nm range. Optimize layers 8-9 and 11-20 with gradient-based optimizer. Evaluate transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and reflectance in 400-700 nm band at normal incidence. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize a 21-layer HfO2/SiO2 defect-cavity stack on fused silica substrate under normal incidence air illumination. Freeze coating layers 0–7 at prescribed thicknesses. Fix central cavity layer 10 at 200.0 nm to meet the 380–430 nm optical thickness requirement. Gradient-optimize remaining finite layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in the 1530–1565 nm band and maximize reflectance in the 400–700 nm band, while minimizing leakage in both bands. Report performance scores, valid candidates, margins, and final thicknesses post-run.",
